      "type": "文本消息",
      "str_content": "各位公司金融课程的同学好~我是本课程助教。为了帮助老师优化后续教学，诚邀大家花1-2分钟填写第一节课后反馈问卷，内容涉及课程难度、金融背景、兴趣话题等，全程匿名且结果仅用于教学优化。点击下方链接即可填写，您的反馈对我们很重要，感谢支持！\n\nDear students of Corporate Finance, I’m the teaching assistant for this course. To help the instructor optimize future teaching, we sincerely invite you to spend 1-2 minutes filling out the post-first-class feedback survey. It covers topics like course difficulty, financial background, and interested topics. The survey is completely anonymous and the results will only be used for teaching improvement. Please click the link below to fill it out. Your feedback is very important to us. Thank you for your support!\n\nhttps://v.wjx.cn/vm/PWgcqyu.aspx",
