      "create_time": 1764234473,
      "formatted_time": "2025-11-27 17:07:53",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "str_content": "@所有人 【作业提交通知】Case 1 作业提交要求\n各位公司金融课程的同学好～\n\n提醒大家，Case 1 作业将于 12月2日24:00（下周三凌晨） 截止提交，相关要求如下：\n1. 作业内容：需包含 1 份 Excel 文件（数据计算/分析）+ 1 份 Word/PDF 文件（问题回答）；\n2. 提交形式：以小组为单位提交，每组仅需提交 1 份，由组长提交；\n3. 文件命名规范：\n   - 先创建文件夹，命名格式：GroupX-Case1（X 为小组编号，示例：Group1-Case1）；\n   - 将 Excel 和 Word/PDF 文件放入该文件夹，压缩为压缩包（压缩包命名与文件夹一致）；\n4. 提交方式：直接将压缩包通过微信发送给我（助教）。\n\n请大家合理安排时间，按时完成提交～ 如有疑问，欢迎随时沟通！\n\n---\n\n# Notice: Case 1 Assignment Submission Requirements\nDear students of Corporate Finance,\n\nThis is a reminder that the Case 1 assignment is due by 24:00 on December 2nd . Please follow the submission guidelines below:\n1. Assignment Content: 1 Excel file (data calculation/analysis) + 1 Word/PDF file (question answers);\n2. Submission Format: Submit as a group (one submission per group, to be submitted by the group leader);\n3. File Naming Rules:\n   - First create a folder named \"GroupX-Case1\" (X = group number, e.g., Group1-Case1);\n   - Place the Excel and Word/PDF files into the folder, then compress it into a zip file (zip file name must match the folder name);\n4. Submission Method: Send the zip file directly to me (TA) via WeChat.\n\nPlease arrange your time properly and submit on time. Feel free to reach out if you have any questions!",
      "is_send": 0,
      "sender_name": "彭俊臻 24 金投",
      "sender_wxid": "wxid_5964649647112"
    },
